d_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/commits/354509c281116c6eb03de8fd0b4f5aaf8090b9a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T06:37:42Z","email":"steven@steventan.com.au","name":"Steven Tan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T06:37:42Z","email":"steven@steventan.com.au","name":"Steven Tan"},"message":"Pull in other people''s Stratify saves and suggest admins to share with\n\n- Poll a new chart head endpoint every 30 seconds while the builder is\n  visible; pull others'' saves straight in when nothing is unsaved, and\n  otherwise show a \"saved changes · Pull in\" banner that merges like a\n  save, following sharing and role changes\n- Show a banner and stop polling once the chart can no longer be opened\n- Suggest admins by partial name or email in the Share panel through a\n  new admins search endpoint; use the shared single select for roles and\n  put the Share button on its own line\n- Flag collaborators who lost the admin role in the owner''s People list\n- Render public charts through the builder''s normaliser, so legacy\n  presets get the same palette everywhere\n- Rebuild reset() from the field registry; delete the unused\n  ChartManager and the snapshot module\n- Test two builder sessions against the real save, restore and sharing\n  code with an in-memory Sanity","tree":{"sha":"25925d665dc9717e29d40f16e3c010d3513b212d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/trees/25925d665dc9717e29d40f16e3c010d3513b212d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/commits/354509c281116c6eb03de8fd0b4f5aaf8090b9a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reaso