 Timeline''s intervals to Compare and fix rolling-sum gaps\n\n- Share Timeline''s interval pill, 12-mth rolling switch and\n  calendar-period filter as IntervalControls, and give Compare the\n  same Month to Year grains, rolling variants and compare-filter\n- Remove Compare''s Daily interval with its year navigator, daily\n  providers and buffer; older 1d links open on rolling months\n- Move Compare''s footnotes under the Regions table in a shared\n  TableFootnotes box, as the fuel-tech table''s notes\n- State that official renewables include battery discharge, link OE''s\n  renewables guide from the shared RENEWABLES_DOCS, and add an\n  Excl. batteries toggle that sums the renewable fuel techs\n- Count padding nulls before a fueltech starts or after it retires as\n  absent, and idle plant''s nulls as zero, removing year-long rolling\n  gaps in SA, NSW and WA; only genuinely missing months stay blank\n- Label WA without the WEM suffix in the heatmap","tree":{"sha":"6f610df3d141d0c3c1a5888290dc928c6392051b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/trees/6f610df3d141d0c3c1a5888290dc928c6392051b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/commits/13e877ecae045d8c43da6e4caf8ab4e5deb10e34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chienleng","id":349944,"login":"chienleng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/received_events","repos_url