 before the stacked area\n- Outline the table column a hovered card plots and darken its border, as\n  the breakdown does: Av power, Energy or Contribution for Generation, Av\n  price for Market, Emissions or Intensity, and Av power for Stacked\n  (`chartTableColumn`)\n- Highlight a hovered stack series'' row and fade the other series, with the\n  shared cell in white on OE red (`NetworkChart` `onhoverkeychange`)\n- Report card hover through `ChartCard`''s `onhover`, replacing the\n  breakdown''s wrapper element\n- Mark the table''s focused row and column header with `data-focused`","tree":{"sha":"a020009455204f6aea135fa65d210b9e7fdf3642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/trees/a020009455204f6aea135fa65d210b9e7fdf3642"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/commits/c8c4ba905dbebc5fb299cb97e0ebb80b371e3a59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chienleng","id":349944,"login":"chienleng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/opennem/openelectricity/commit/c8c4