 /tracker/compare; /tracker and retired ?view= links redirect there\n  with the rest of the query intact\n- Compose each view page from a shared TrackerShell (filter bar, options\n  menu, notices, PNG export, shortcuts), replacing the single page''s\n  three-way view branching; each page owns its controls, status and exports\n- Give each view page its own session via createTrackerPage(), dropping\n  selectView and the view from the URL state; navigation owns its route''s\n  path and reconciles Back onto another view''s shallow history entry\n- Load the comparison CPI only on /tracker/compare\n- Keep one TRACKER_VIEWS table of views, labels and route ids\n- Check export readiness cheaply for menu state (isExportPending, canExport)\n- Hold the view switcher still across the view transition while its thumb\n  slides (SwitchWithIcons transitionName)\n- Turn svelte/no-navigation-without-resolve off for every file, matching\n  its existing no-base-path rationale","tree":{"sha":"a284e67e53e99c8e919d307af948704bd0e249d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/trees/a284e67e53e99c8e919d307af948704bd0e249d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/commits/5841983fe9bb9fcbfef600816bf162f4319c3417","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chienleng","id":349944,"login":"chienleng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/received_events","re