age":"Set keyboard keys in the mono font\n\n- A base-layer rule gives every kbd element the DM Mono face, so key badges\n  no longer need a font class.\n- The shortcuts modal, options menu rows, search hint, facility spotlight and\n  fullscreen footer drop their per-element font-sans overrides.","tree":{"sha":"f21128a33c814b64291422582cb31845670d92db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/trees/f21128a33c814b64291422582cb31845670d92db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/commits/fa2821ce9e429bbfbf2e70f0440782227accf0be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chienleng","id":349944,"login":"chienleng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/opennem/openelectricity/commit/fa2821ce9e429bbfbf2e70f0440782227accf0be","node_id":"C_kwDOKeRSa9oAKGZhMjgyMWNlOWU0MjliYmZiZjJlNzBmMDQ0MDc4MjIyN2FjY2YwYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opennem/openelectricity/commit/8787055461ec5b56a7a3f1a277bebf0ab63e5693","sha":"8787055461ec5b56a7a3f1a277bebf0ab63e5693","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/commits/8787055461ec5b56a7a3f1a277bebf0ab63e5693"}],"sha":"fa2821ce9e429bbfbf2e70f0440782227accf0be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/commits/fa2821ce9e429bbfbf2e70f0440782227accf0be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chienleng","id":349944,"login":"chienleng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/commits/8787055461ec5b56a7a3f1a277bebf0ab63e5693/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T08:07:07Z","email":"steven@steventan.com.au","name":"Steven Tan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T08:07:07Z","email":"steven@steventan.com.au","name":"Steven Tan"},"message":"Show Tracker window metrics as a strip and refresh on demand\n\n- The Timeline''s window metrics leave the docked left pane for a single-line\n  ticker strip between the nav and the charts: uppercase Space Grotesk titles,\n  mono values with red min/max icons, each value''s time in its tooltip, units\n  beside the value for power, energy, demand and curtailment. It scrolls\n  sideways with a hidden scrollbar and edge fades, slides shut with the M key\n  or an Options menu row, and remembers that as a local preference.\n- Metrics run net energy (daily and longer grains), net power, demand,\n  renewables, the price measure, emissions volume, emissions intensity, and\n  solar and wind curtailment. The emissions pair reads a headless\n  emissions_intensity components provider shared with the chart; curtailment\n  reuses the overlay provider. Net power is the bucket average on energy\n  grains. A partial window and ties are no longer flagged on the strip.\n- Charts and the strip share one focus time: pinning an extreme moves the\n  charts'' focus line, pinning a time on a plot presses the matching extremes,\n  and either clears both. NetworkChart gains controlled focusTime and\n  onfocuschange.\n- getTimeFormatPolicy gains formatShort (\"19 Sept, 11:30 pm\", the year only\n  outside the current one) via a new formatDayMonthTime.\n- The tracker no longer polls. The range readout is a button whose tooltip\n  says when data last loaded; tapping it, the R key or \"Refresh data\" in the\n  Options menu runs session.refresh, which revisits the newest buckets, forces\n  past the response caches with cache: ''no-cache'', and advances a following\n  window. A minute clock only keeps freshness labels current. The /facilities\n  shortcuts modal opens with ? and lists R, M, F and ?; F now toggles full\n  screen here too.\n- The Sparkline moves to $lib/components/charts and loses its card-only\n  props; Tooltip gains a linkLabel; the e2e suite is rewritten around the\n  strip, the shared focus and manual refresh.","tree":{"sha":"71c82e60ab70742ff5bdf1d3d48ad8e712bc82a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/trees/71c82e60ab70742ff5bdf1d3d48ad8e712bc82a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/commits/8787055461ec5b56a7a3f1a277bebf0ab63e5693","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chienleng","id":349944,"login":"chienleng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/opennem/openelectricity/commit/8787055461ec5b56a7a3f1a277bebf0ab63e5693","node_id":"C_kwDOKeRSa9oAKDg3ODcwNTU0NjFlYzViNTZhN2EzZjFhMjc3YmViZjBhYjYzZTU2OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opennem/openelectricity/commit/b2f64fa0fc9dff884aa8aa0896f0d3ddfeb7ac15","sha":"b2f64fa0fc9dff884aa8aa0896f0d3ddfeb7ac15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/commits/b2f64fa0fc9dff884aa8aa0896f0d3ddfeb7ac15"}],"sha":"8787055461ec5b56a7a3f1a277bebf0ab63e5693","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/commits/8787055461ec5b56a7a3f1a277bebf0ab63e5693"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chienleng","id":349944,"login":"chienleng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/commits/b2f64fa0fc9dff884aa8aa0896f0d3ddfeb7ac15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T08:06:44Z","email":"steven@steventan.com.au","name":"Steven Tan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T08:06:44Z","email":"steven@steventan.com.au","name":"Steven Tan"},"message":"Use FilterSelect pills for the range bar and Profile controls\n\n- ChartRangeBar swaps its Bits UI Select for FilterSelect: the 12-month\n  rolling toggle sits in the list footer, grains without a rolling variant are\n  dimmed while rolling, and the bucket filter uses the same pill.\n- The Profile view''s View and Window selects become FilterSelect pills, with\n  their options in time-of-day.js.\n- FilterSelect gains disabled options and a footer snippet; FilterPanel,\n  FilterPill and FilterDropdown gain a disabled state and a panelClass;\n  inactive pills and the SwitchWithIcons track use the lighter warm-grey\n  border; the fullscreen filter bar gets a soft shadow.\n- formatWithUnit joins a value to its unit with dollar units leading; the v2\n  chart tooltips use it and the comparison tables use formatPrice.\n- E2E helpers navPill and pickNavOption replace the old combobox steps.","tree":{"sha":"28878cf5759cef8b6468cc95cbed0dee7ef474a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/trees/28878cf5759cef8b6468cc95cbed0dee7ef474a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/op