eading with an optional header snippet; its five\n  consumers drop their duplicate headings.\n- Rebuild Select on Bits UI Select for desktop dropdowns, where the highlight\n  moves without committing and Enter or Space commits and closes, and on Radio\n  Group for expanded mobile lists; group headings become labelled listbox groups.\n- Make Checkbox a Bits UI Checkbox with the documentation styling, delete the\n  CheckboxNew and Checkbox2 wrappers and let labels inherit the caller''s\n  typography.\n- Add a decorative RadioIndicator and remove RadioBigButton''s radio-only\n  variant, which nested a focusable radio inside the scenario card button.\n- Show Timeline hover values in the shared ChartTooltip strip instead of a\n  floating tooltip, and publish settled table data immediately behind a 200 ms\n  loading notice.\n- Keep per-group emissions-intensity components in one manager so hiding a\n  technology filters cached data instead of creating a manager and refetching.\n- Move grouping, contribution and table-column choices into an accessible Fuel\n  technology options modal that persists in the URL and history.\n- Update the tracker README, add the component review inventory and extend\n  unit and browser coverage.","tree":{"sha":"13f01402f8d6e5d8a96b87006f956c15765bdae3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/trees/13f01402f8d6e5d8a96b87006f956c15765bdae3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/commits/e606d01a1d2076917839807642928cdbf8cca49a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/gists{/gist_id}","grav