or the client and effects actually run; add jsdom.\n- Allow rune globals in rune-module test files.\n- Harness the legacy rune suites with effect roots and the real jsdom\n  window and storage.\n- Add reactive fixtures and a stubbed fetch, and cover the tracker''s table\n  latch, metrics feed and provider lifecycles.","tree":{"sha":"6ebbcdd35edcc824f5b11796d7a0c1d0e3818db3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/trees/6ebbcdd35edcc824f5b11796d7a0c1d0e3818db3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/commits/90dc0d93e3456b969c04db84e1b4ae77983b2739","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chienleng","id":349944,"login":"chienleng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/opennem/openelectricity/commit/90dc0d93e3456b969c04db84e1b4ae77983b2739","node_id":"C_kwDOKeRSa9oAKDkwZGMwZDkzZTM0NTZiOTY5YzA0ZGI4NGUxYjRhZTc3OTgzYjI3Mzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opennem/openelectricity/commit/76636929165232ff84fd1d592d0f518988b677ad","sha":"76636929165232ff84fd1d592d0f518988b677ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/commits/76636929165232ff84fd1d592d0f518988b677ad"}],"sha":"90dc0d93e3456b969c04db84e1b4ae77983b2739","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/commits/90dc0d93e3456b969c04db84e1b4ae77983b2739"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chienleng","id":349944,"login":"chienleng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/commits/76636929165232ff84fd1d592d0f518988b677ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T02:35:26Z","email":"steven@steventan.com.au","name":"Steven Tan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T02:35:26Z","email":"steven@steventan.com.au","name":"Steven Tan"},"message":"Restructure the Tracker around shared state, data owners and panels\n\n- Normalise the selection in one place behind URL parsing, URL writing and\n  the session, which now exposes the view and network time zone.\n- Move the accepted-table latch into the table owner, add a metrics feed\n  owner and let the providers decide the renewables share source.\n- Rebuild the profile data source on the headless provider with an exact\n  window, and make region comparison assembly, status and activation pure.\n- Extract the table''s show/hide rules, the docked metrics, table and regions\n  panels, the shared chart props and the panel header and rail chrome.\n- Judge the region comparison''s common period by the displayed charts, file\n  date-comparison loads by the table''s rule, keep one chart store across\n  profile and comparison updates, and split the comparison chart''s sync\n  effects.\n- Export every view''s CSV through the shared dataset serialiser with one\n  zone label and one filename convention.\n- Mark the page hydrated so automation does not click the SSR skeleton.","tree":{"sha":"fd12883db82163a8b17c78a2f7a2b07a54ac052d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/trees/fd12883db82163a8b17c78a2f7a2b07a54ac052d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/commits/76636929165232ff84fd1d592d0f518988b677ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chienleng","id":349944,"login":"chienleng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng"