lpers for the Tracker\n\n- Export the combined NEM + WEM scope, the spot-price rule and a region\n  label lookup from the regions registry; the studio tracker re-exports them.\n- Add an observation-row predicate to the bucket filter, offset-keyed zone\n  labels to the network time helpers and export the All-tier threshold.\n- Give the headless series provider an exact-window option and expose its\n  series metadata; the fetch window helpers take an exact flag.\n- Add a docked-panel helper with a remembered size and open/close focus\n  hand-off, plus pure percentage panel bounds with tests.\n- Promote the facilities filter dropdown, option list and search input to\n  the shared filters library and update their importers.","tree":{"sha":"4502143229ace9158ab4214cb87cf4fdf04346eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/trees/4502143229ace9158ab4214cb87cf4fdf04346eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/commits/b964561784cc329858c5bbea45e3096e660eab01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chienleng","id":349944,"login":"chienleng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/subscriptions","type":"User"