leng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/opennem/openelectricity/commit/42c8e8da38ac0d9fdbcae9c2b368119db06b6292","node_id":"C_kwDOKeRSa9oAKDQyYzhlOGRhMzhhYzBkOWZkYmNhZTljMmIzNjgxMTlkYjA2YjYyOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opennem/openelectricity/commit/77c52ca08ec0ac458c675b731404311dc29fb812","sha":"77c52ca08ec0ac458c675b731404311dc29fb812","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/commits/77c52ca08ec0ac458c675b731404311dc29fb812"}],"sha":"42c8e8da38ac0d9fdbcae9c2b368119db06b6292","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/commits/42c8e8da38ac0d9fdbcae9c2b368119db06b6292"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chienleng","id":349944,"login":"chienleng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTk0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/commits/77c52ca08ec0ac458c675b731404311dc29fb812/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T07:58:16Z","email":"steven@steventan.com.au","name":"Steven Tan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T07:58:16Z","email":"steven@steventan.com.au","name":"Steven Tan"},"message":"Add Tracker CSV and XLSX data export\n\n- Add `tracker-export.js`: one `ExportDataset` shape feeding both the CSV rows (Generation, Market, Emissions, Fuel tech table) and a single XLSX workbook with a Summary sheet; volume-weighted price and intensity lines are re-derived from their exported components.\n- Add `download-xlsx.js` on top of a shared `downloadBlob`, loading `write-excel-file` on demand so it stays off the page bundle; timestamps become real network-local date-time cells.\n- Expose `getExportContext()` from the canvas, tagging price/emissions snapshots with their scope and metric so only current data is exported.\n- Give `PageOptionsMenu` an optional \"Download as XLSX\" group.\n- Add a window Energy column to the fuel-tech table with its own MWh/GWh/TWh prefix, keep Av power in MW unless the chart shows power, and show emissions in plain tonnes.\n- Move `formatNetworkTimestamp` into the shared network-time helpers and drop the panel''s range label.","tree":{"sha":"0a018ec6b8c3516fd88bd5ae5e1f66f84278d6e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/trees/0a018ec6b8c3516fd88bd5ae5e1f66f84278d6e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/commits/77c52ca08ec0ac458c675b731404311dc29fb812","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/use