received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chienleng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/commits/5e0b19ec6e9a118b14b9e64a418e8df6a3888141/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T01:02:59Z","email":"steven@steventan.com.au","name":"Steven Tan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T01:02:59Z","email":"steven@steventan.com.au","name":"Steven Tan"},"message":"Refactor Tracker table and add a narrow column carousel\n\n- Fold the three headless network providers into one core\n  (headless-series-provider) and generalise the fuel-tech provider to any\n  grouped metric; add a per-fuel-tech emissions feed for the table.\n- Consolidate tracker defaults, overlay registry, range maths and URL codec;\n  drop the duplicate DEFAULT_REGION and inline the region dropdown.\n- Rebuild the fuel-tech table on row descriptors and add Emissions (tCO₂e,\n  one column prefix) and Intensity (kgCO₂e/MWh) columns.\n- Below 660px the Technology column pins with a right rule and scroll\n  shadow while value columns become a scroll-snap carousel driven by a\n  container query, with a tab strip that tracks and scrolls the columns.\n- Move the grouping and contribution-basis pickers into the nav options\n  menu as radio rows; echo the choices as header sub-labels.\n- Always show the drag grips on the tracker''s resize handles.\n- Add unit tests for the new pure modules and Playwright coverage for the\n  carousel and options menu.","tree":{"sha":"0587eb61106fd1ae5dff58b4518cde5ce0184f05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/trees/0587eb61106fd1ae5dff58b4518cde5ce0184f05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opennem/openelectricity/git/commit