ithub.com/users/markuczy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markuczy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markuczy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markuczy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markuczy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-portal-ui-libs/commits/3a2991c49a8137bc4604bb733f1cc1d75cc51701/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:48:23Z","email":"129275100+markuczy@users.noreply.github.com","name":"markuczy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:48:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(angular-21): fix stale AI prompt text, auth-package export gap, and nx-plugin version conflict (#1775)\n\n- Fix ai-prompt-20-to-21.adoc copy-paste bug claiming to migrate\n  Angular 18->19 instead of 20->21\n- Clarify that only AuthServiceWrapper/provideAuthService are public\n  @onecx/shell-auth exports in v8; KeycloakAuthService/DisabledAuthService/\n  AuthService exist as source but are not re-exported\n- Fix @onecx/nx-plugin version conflict between update-v8-packages.adoc\n  (^22.1.3) and update-nx-angular-version-21.adoc (^8); nx-plugin is\n  versioned independently of the onecx-portal-ui-libs packages\n- Clarify @onecx/nx-migration-utils removal is mandatory (package no\n  longer published in v8), not optional cleanup\n- Note the @angular-architects/module-federation -> @module-federation/\n  enhanced + @module-federation/runtime-core package swap\n\nPer internal-tasks#584, scoped to a v7.999.0->v8.0.0 diff audit. Does NOT\nremove the guide''s work-in-progress notice or touch adjust-ngrx-utilities.adoc/\nesm-bundling.adoc, since #584 explicitly depends on #583 and #833 (file/anchor\nswap fix) landing first; see PR description for details.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"956793d41c73d875497326a39babdf0d4e11f889","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-portal-ui-libs/git/trees/956793d41c73d875497326a39babdf0d4e11f889"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-portal-ui-libs/git/commits/3a2991c49a8137bc4604bb733f1cc1d75cc51701","verification":{"payload":"tree 956793d41c73d875497326a39babdf0d4e11f889\nparent c67e629ed100e22da5ae80168086b56ddcc98d39\nauthor markuczy <129275100+markuczy@users.noreply.github.com> 1791197303 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791197303 +0200\n\ndocs(angular-21): fix stale AI prompt text, auth-package export gap, and nx-plugin version conflict (#1775)\n\n- Fix ai-prompt-20-to-21.adoc copy-paste bug claiming to migrate\n  Angular 18->19 instead of 20->21\n- Clarify that only AuthServiceWrapper/provideAuthService are public\n  @onecx/shell-auth exports in v8; KeycloakAuthService/DisabledAuthService/\n  AuthService exist as source but are not re-exported\n- Fix @onecx/nx-plugin version conflict between update-v8-packages.adoc\n  (^22.1.3) and update-nx-angular-version-21.adoc (^8); nx-plugin is\n  versioned independently of the onecx-portal-ui-libs packages\n- Clarify @onecx/nx-migration-utils removal is mandatory (package no\n  longer published in v8), not optional cleanup\n- Note the @angular-architects/module-federation -> @module-federation/\n  enhanced + @module-federation/runtime-core package swap\n\nPer internal-tasks#584, scoped to a v7.999.0->v8.0.0 diff audit. Does NOT\nremove the guide''s work-in-progress notice or touch adjust-ngrx-utilities.adoc/\nesm-bundling.adoc, since #584 explicitly depends on #583 and #833 (file/anchor\nswap fix) landing first; see PR description for details.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw4B3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgoEQAE8MluwT/pS0wxM7z3aXEmA2\nJmR45Vr/hoelD1y9OgvmZ0FIqHEGqtRft+K9gvv8vy4XD5e1lc9SUdq/K1RjmcyR\nfkzNXTMtFDn3daAbX+J5bzZrdMaQT27cfAKYtW+9b