GitHub"},"message":"fix(react): improve permission provider performance and i18n initiali… (#1587)\n\n* fix(react): improve permission provider performance and i18n initialization\n\n- Add i18n initialization guard in TranslationBridge to prevent errors when i18next is not initialized\n- Refactor useTopic to use useState instead of useRef for React 19 compliance\n- Add StrictMode resilience to useTopic with setTimeout(0) + isMountedRef\n- Align PermissionProvider with Angular PermissionService: add caching, remove state accumulation\n- Switch PermissionProvider to use useTopic for automatic topic lifecycle management\n- Update all related tests\n\n* fix(test): add useTopic mock to withSlot.test.tsx\n\n* fix(test): add useTopic mock to useSlot.test.tsx to avoid ts-semaphore import error\n\n* fix(test): add useTopic mock to usePermission.test.tsx to avoid ts-semaphore import error\n\n* fix(translationBridge): remove void operator from i18n.init call\n\n* refactor(translationBridge): skip changeLanguage when i18n not initialized instead of manual init\n\n- Remove module-level i18nInitialized flag and ensureI18nInitialized function\n- Remove i18next import and __resetI18nInitialized test export\n- Guard i18n.changeLanguage with i18n.isInitialized check in useEffect\n- Update tests: remove init mock tests, add isInitialized guard test","tree":{"sha":"34e2c352f4614d67e10cd2f4b680d87325215acd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-portal-ui-libs/git/trees/34e2c352f4614d67e10cd2f4b680d87325215acd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-portal-ui-libs/git/commits/784b1b8ea9706303c3196e3c019b761eb9548ce6","verification":{"payload":"tree 34e2c352f4614d67e10cd2f4b680d87325215acd\nparent 93bdb040df82eb879b6c3694329c1b40ea276c2c\nauthor Kamil Nowak <51134450+qnowak@users.noreply.github.com> 1783344321 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783344321 +0200\n\nfix(react): improve permission provider performance and i18n initiali… (#1587)\n\n* fix(react): 