.github.com/users/qnowak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-portal-ui-libs/commits/9b43259559a8df3c60f70b2f253080b93fda45d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:25:23Z","email":"51134450+qnowak@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kamil Nowak"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:25:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix/v9-styles PrimeReact style isolation (#1473)\n\n* fix(react): stabilize PrimeReact scoping and React 19 tests\n\n* fix: enhance StyleRegistry to tag PrimeReact styles with app suffix\n\n* refactor: streamline theme styling and PrimeReact style id handling\n\n- Refactored StyleRegistry to utilize new utility functions for style id deduplication and tagging.\n- Improved applyThemeVariables to enhance CSS variable management and scoped style application.\n- Introduced primeStyleRegistry for sanitizing and tagging PrimeReact style ids.\n- Added tests for new style registry utilities and updated existing tests for applyThemeVariables.\n- Removed deprecated scopeAppCssChunk plugin in favor of new primeReactStyleReusePlugin for better style id management.\n\n* fix: update imports to use correct path for app globals and enhance regex patterns in style reuse plugin\n\n* fix: enhance PrimeReact style patching to support double-quoted selectors and streamline regex patterns\n\n* refactor(theme): streamline theme variable application and scoped style handling\n\n- Removed unused functions and comments from applyThemeVariables.ts to enhance readability.\n- Updated applyThemeVariables to accept a queryRoot parameter for better scope management.\n- Introduced scopedStyleContainer.ts to manage scoped style elements with a Proxy for improved isolation in multi-app environments.\n- Added comprehensive tests for scopedStyleContainer to ensure correct behavior of style ID extraction and Proxy functionality.\n- Deleted deprecated primeStyleRegistry and related tests to clean up the codebase.\n- Removed unused Vite plugin for PrimeReact style reuse, simplifying the styling integration.\n\n* refactor: clean up comments and improve code readability in scopedStyleContainer","tree":{"sha":"f0e079acf4c020256cd44277ca9207ec2797b4aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-portal-ui-libs/git/trees/f0e079acf4c020256cd44277ca9207ec2797b4aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-portal-ui-libs/git/commits/9b43259559a8df3c60f70b2f253080b93fda45d3","verification":{"payload":"tree f0e079acf4c020256cd44277ca9207ec2797b4aa\nparent 04cb74be2a21260d2a26792e242fe0afa2ee5659\nauthor Kamil Nowak <51134450+qnowak@users.noreply.github.com> 1779805523 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779805523 +0200\n\nFix/v9-styles PrimeReact style isolation (#1473)\n\n* fix(react): stabilize PrimeReact scoping and React 19 tests\n\n* fix: enhance StyleRegistry to tag PrimeReact styles with app suffix\n\n* refactor: streamline theme styling and PrimeReact style id handling\n\n- Refactored StyleRegistry to utilize new utility functions for style id deduplication and tagging.\n- Improved applyThemeVariables to enhance CSS variable management and scoped style application.\n- Introduced primeStyleRegistry for sanitizing and tagging PrimeReact style ids.\n- Added tests for new style registry utilities and updated existing tests for applyThemeVariables.\n- Removed deprecated scopeAppCssChunk plugin in favor of new primeReactStyleReusePlugin for better style id management.\n\n* fix: update imports to use correct path for app globals and enhance regex patterns in style reuse plugin\n\n* fix: enhance PrimeReact style patching to support double-quoted selectors and streamline regex patterns\n\n* refactor(theme): streamline theme variable application and scoped style handling\n\n- Removed unused functions and comments from applyThemeVariables.ts to enhance readability.\n- Updated applyThemeVariables to accept a queryRoot parameter for better scope management.\n- Introduced scopedStyleContainer.ts to manage scoped style elements with a Proxy for improved isolation in multi-app environments.\n- Added comprehensive tests for scopedStyleContainer to ensure correct behavior of style ID extraction and Proxy functionality.\n- Deleted deprecated primeStyleRegistry and related tests to clean up the codebase.\n- Removed unused Vite plugin for PrimeReact style reuse, simplifying the styling integration.\n\n* refactor: clean up comments and improve code readability in scopedStyleContainer","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFa1TCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGy4QAFPXCgRf/+umOp6Srby09DYm\ndaIaQZYr/I1fAfRcU2PHdVeVhPBfIfCxLo3v1i3e7E/sx4zx4VGzqVgTVbIyd3eD\nqwMLQmgQ5LvX2tgca4MULyDr7O1uBwtBNYpAbx6wHoGIQcBzNRxZuOg+n1SORhsO\nr4xHAEVrOTNheMIJ0rKf8w9vhaJuMOYZXR/Fwym7JyI8BtwLFS6gy2YZ4DBviFYY\nUMtvAlh3iKydI2GiPC496EaGUa0vZcpbnGuc6NYYPHeF2b6r+3m/YOiK1o6wmLW5\nSCxmRN+5Nel2s+ey4rCvtwwQVHkWUbBAruSIepw8z9A+qnsZp2P2CFf5Hk1Lumk5\n+OX1yaSL+lkVhC+dK0uTfmVAq516LLtBxQYvn6tc5pWSHUQyDfe9MBi6um9snf8g\n+hTfW790o0K5NdGeDirsty9EZBMXJjyyE509nOwJKr0WZ17Q6jc1LVvzZvccvPuV\n/G5nGIkjGlSZZSIA3ZDIXEPhFrNA0CIyU/admIcbNCFaLJ5JsHBsM66VFijl5RNF\n8Qg59j5VKXPP52LY0cj04ECkNpeWcF8O0ltSWsk/Q/Uin1SRIaUXk6i47iScIUKU\nOZEH7uhv0+bDIFC14dIVRCFyvC6HMDE2Rl//2c2pcOL1CiUJdyZGcp92hC1HoCzY\nYHyYbfI0EMJfrONF4rgS\n=lHBM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-26T14:25:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/