x-portal-ui-libs/commit/80ed8b43eeb0ec04b132d169cfb2fcdf9799c2d5","sha":"80ed8b43eeb0ec04b132d169cfb2fcdf9799c2d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-portal-ui-libs/commits/80ed8b43eeb0ec04b132d169cfb2fcdf9799c2d5"}],"sha":"c828823bffd90dc7deb79a901ad6ce45205738e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-portal-ui-libs/commits/c828823bffd90dc7deb79a901ad6ce45205738e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51134450?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/qnowak","id":51134450,"login":"qnowak","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTM0NDUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-portal-ui-libs/commits/80ed8b43eeb0ec04b132d169cfb2fcdf9799c2d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T10:10:02Z","email":"51134450+qnowak@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kamil Nowak"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T10:10:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: React libs typescript (#1425)\n\n* fix: add explicit types field to package.json exports for react libraries\n\n* fix: standardize package.json exports configuration for react libraries\n\nUpdate module entry points to use dist directory, add explicit module field, set package type to module, add default export condition, and include package.json export for all react libraries (react-auth, react-integration-interface, react-remote-components, react-utils, react-webcomponents)\n\n* fix: simplify package.json entry points by removing dist and src directory prefixes for react libraries\n\nUpdate main, module, types, and exports paths to reference files at package root instead of dist/src directories. Standardize require exports to use .cjs extension across all react libraries (react-auth, react-integration-interface, react-remote-components, react-utils, react-webcomponents)\n\n* fix: rename eslint.config.js to eslint.config.cjs for react libraries to use CommonJS format\n\nRename eslint configuration files from .js to .cjs extension across all react libraries (react-auth, react-integration-interface, react-remote-components, react-utils, react-webcomponents) to explicitly use CommonJS module format\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Bastian Jakobi <55296998+bastianjakobi@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac08575ac2a9f327d3e2b630e7483e5d41dfa15c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-portal-ui-libs/git/trees/ac08575ac2a9f327d3e2b630e7483e5d41dfa15c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-portal-ui-libs/git/commits/80ed8b43eeb0ec04b132d169cfb2fcdf9799c2d5","verification":{"payload":"tree ac08575ac2a9f327d3e2b630e7483e5d41dfa15c\nparent af3b8c859d640e911ae0fe2ba886cdd6a82fc0c8\nauthor Kamil Nowak <51134450+qnowak@users.noreply.github.com> 1778580602 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778580602 +0000\n\nfix: React libs typescript (#1425)\n\n* fix: add explicit types field to package.json exports for react libraries\n\n* fix: standardize package.json exports configuration for react libraries\n\nUpdate module entry points to use dist directory, add explicit module field, set package type to module, add default export condition, and include package.json export for all react libraries (react-auth, react-integration-interface, react-remote-components, react-utils, react-webcomponents)\n\n* fix: simplify package.json entry points by removing dist and src directory prefixes for react libraries\n\nUpdate main, module, types, and exports paths to reference files at package root instead of dist/src directories. Standardize require exports to use .cjs extension across all react libraries (react-auth, react-integration-interface, react-remote-components, react-utils, react-webcomponents)\n\n* fix: rename eslint.config.js to eslint.config.cjs for react libraries to use CommonJS format\n\nRename eslint configuration files from .js to .cjs extension across all react libraries (react-auth, react-integration-interface, react-remote-components, react-utils, react-webcomponents) to explicitly use CommonJS module format\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Bastian Jakobi <55296998+bastianjakobi@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqAvx6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1xQQAABKTbIZViajvVFnuHySg2jC\nIqKaD425rbXQTHNvfKqJ2gsBDPZEpbPgodsPekO1mc2iTiepN+MEs6qtBrbhjrq7\nScW4a8AJgxq3ZE52sxmFQG+Yk8/Y+0ZMevW2Uc9cCKZ2L8InL8Rvd9mPPIloqa10\nV7lwPH96hMmKGZCEEtm1dytX18En5bV3JjyT6zVERtSW6ygWAJh2homSaXA7racv\nj4pRmvSJRp543URMzYF5iWy+s61WhqCmqH13hOcEgUPXuuw8Hofb9jyj+40j+vDD\n0XV5inQo060AcJ8/qiPFfEEM60tgNEAvnpdLzNY05O+dW8Yuf9ot+/5cReFIXpck\negk2L775hjX4ESd9LySX/KxefkVsRPF9Tnf5TnjhL0QclrSr7Fwb0wyzyrXuGuyJ\nOYvpdb58kgw16FY64XaTnJRhTkiECVs0djT7S2M8l7r3MQ7Xy3ixWFjHTvTBsubt\n5qz81WgPmwcHQtMUNUzzWkeJxcrDfcSwUfXF6KipO8LVjothYD/MKwRBW0pAFnKM\nrw7v/Wc/4UMS8hjnW7eMqCUtEzsWnji2f7aPUJHb6S3YzE5sLUg5DFFeURKk1Qao\nSUnOnmnayKm+zBfsDFjOEi+2Q+DZyshBluTdyCrsGAQ1qEYOHjKgzEGTLngmgHUE\n8pbQi+JmL+2SBGFaLyJl\n=oIuE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-12T10:10:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","foll