ps://api.github.com/users/RudoiDmytro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RudoiDmytro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RudoiDmytro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RudoiDmytro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RudoiDmytro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RudoiDmytro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VilnaCRM-Org/crm/commits/eaab4638378e518f9b6fe3da92aeca5900d364ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T12:26:16Z","email":"82976108+RudoiDmytro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Rudoi Dmytro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T12:26:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: migrate from Redux to Zustand for auth state management (#46)\n\n* refactor: migrate from Redux to Zustand for auth state management\n\n* fix: address code review feedback\n\n- Remove Apollo Client imports (not in scope for this branch)\n- Use i18n for login error prefix instead of hardcoded Ukrainian\n- Short-circuit AbortError in authStore without user-facing message\n- Use subscription-based loading state check in integration test\n- Fix import order in BaseAPI.test.ts per ESLint rules\n- Add explicit ApiError return type to testHandleApiError\n- Migrate RegistrationForm to use Zustand\n- Add registerUser method to authStore\n- Add comprehensive tests for registerUser (100% coverage)\n- Delete obsolete registrationSlice integration tests\n\n* test: add comprehensive abort error edge case tests\n\n- Test all branches of abort detection: DOMException, name check, message check\n- Add tests for null/undefined errors to cover optional chaining branches\n- Add tests for errors without name or message properties\n- Achieved 100% branch coverage for authStore (from 85.71%)\n- All 937 tests passing with 100% coverage on all metrics\n\n* refactor(auth): centralize abort handling and extend store coverage\n\n* chore: update zustand docs and reset auth test handlers\n\n* chore: allow typescript markdown fences and tighten auth assertions\n\n* fix(auth): treat cancellation errors as aborts\n\n* feat(auth): extract isAbortError utility\n\n* feat(auth): add typed login() API function\n\n* feat(auth): add typed register() API function\n\n* revert(auth): remove register() API function (registration uses GraphQL)\n\n* feat(auth): move authStore into Auth feature module\n\n* refactor(auth): update consumers to use co-located authStore\n\n* feat(auth): restore registerUser for e2e compatibility until GraphQL migration lands\n\n* refactor(auth): split login/register state, add stateSanitizer, reset loginError on unmount\n\n- Split shared loading/error into loginLoading/loginError/registerLoading/registerError\n- Export sanitizeAuthState and wire as stateSanitizer in devtools to redact token\n- Clear loginError on LoginForm unmount to prevent stale error across mode switches\n- Fix import/order ESLint errors in LoginForm, RegistrationForm, login.test, register.test\n\n* test(auth): cover sanitizeAuthState and register selectors in integration tests\n\n* fix(auth): resolve auth lint import ordering\n\n* refactor(auth): update auth forms, store, and test coverage\n\n* test(auth): cover register fallback in integration\n\n* fix(auth): reject failed registration submit and harden tests\n\n* fix(auth): address review feedback for login error handling and tests\n\n* test(auth): strengthen BaseAPI edge fixtures and simplify login error flow\n\n* refactor(#45): complete Zustand migration and normalize module naming\n\nRestore and finalize the Redux to Zustand auth-state migration for PR #46.\n\n- Replace Redux Toolkit auth slices with a Zustand store\n  (auth-store, auth-store-actions, auth-selectors)\n- Centralize DI resolution in resolveDeps() and thread dependencies\n  explicitly through typed action contexts instead of per-call container\n  lookups in the feature layer\n- Rename modules, components, and files to kebab-case\n  (User to user, Auth to auth, PascalCase to kebab-case) and adopt aliases\n- Restructure auth API into repositories (login-api, registration-api, base-api)\n- Restructure apollo-server lib into kebab-case modules\n- Add dependency-cruiser config and CI workflow\n- Localize the login error prefix via i18n (sign_in.error_prefix)\n\n* feat(#45): add structured AuthError and AuthResult types\n\n* feat(#45): add UiError/Zod-issue to AuthError mappers\n\n* feat(#45): add AuthRepository interface and result types\n\n* refactor(#45): use class-based AuthErrorFactory and types-only files\n\n* feat(#45): implement class-based AuthRepository folding API, parsing, and errors\n\n* feat(#45): add auth store types and class-based store actions\n\n* feat(#45): register AuthRepository in DI and allow feature stores folder\n\n* feat(#45): add class-based preloaded-token and auth store selectors\n\n* feat(#45): add feature-local auth store factory and composition root\n\n* refactor(#45): move ProtectedRoute into auth feature and use structured store errors\n\n* refactor(#45): remove legacy src/stores auth store and migrate integration coverage\n\n* docs(#45): document feature-local auth store and container-free DI pattern\n\n* test(#45): fix auth store integration tests and restore 100% coverage\n\n* fix(#45): harden auth store flows\n\n* test(#45): fix auth migration CI coverage\n\n* docs(#45): update agents auth guidance\n\n* docs(#45): warn preloaded auth token is test/LHCI only\n\n* docs(#45): correct preloaded auth token safeguard description\n\n* docs(#45): clarify Make injects default preloaded auth token","tree":{"sha":"55b8f4644779953a2cdbe93b1cb629200ed59946","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VilnaCRM-Org/crm/git/trees/55b8f4644779953a2cdbe93b1cb629200ed59946"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VilnaCRM-Org/crm/git/commits/eaab4638378e518f9b6fe3da92aeca5900d364ae","verification":{"payload":"tree 55b8f4644779953a2cdbe93b1cb629200ed59946\nparent ff3b96cedfc7501a097474f4cd82cd8640bc994b\nauthor Rudoi Dmytro <82976108+RudoiDmytro@users.noreply.github.com> 1780835176 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780835176 +0300\n\nrefactor: migrate from Redux to Zustand for auth state management (#46)\n\n* refactor: migrate from Redux to Zustand for auth state management\n\n* fix: address code review feedback\n\n- Remove Apollo Client imports (not in scope for this branch)\n- Use i18n for login error prefix instead of hardcoded Ukrainian\n- Short-circuit AbortError in authStore without user-facing message\n- Use subscription-based loading state check in integration test\n- Fix import order in BaseAPI.test.ts per ESLint rules\n- Add explicit ApiError return type to testHandleApiError\n- Migrate RegistrationForm to use Zustand\n- Add registerUser method to authStore\n- Add comprehensive tests for registerUser (100% coverage)\n- Delete obsolete registrationSlice integration tests\n\n* test: add comprehensive abort error edge case tests\n\n- Test all branches of abort detection: DOMException, name check, message check\n- Add tests for null/undefined errors to cover optional chaining branches\n- Add tests for errors without name or message properties\n- Achieved 100% branch coverage for authStore (from 85.71%)\n- All 937 tests passing with 100% coverage on all metrics\n\n* refactor(auth): centralize abort handling and extend store coverage\n\n* chore: update zustand docs and reset auth test handlers\n\n* chore: allow typescript markdown fences and tighten auth assertions\n\n* fix(auth): treat cancellation errors as aborts\n\n* feat(auth): extract isAbortError utility\n\n* feat(auth): add typed login() API function\n\n* feat(auth): add typed register() API function\n\n* revert(auth): remove register() API function (registration uses GraphQL)\n\n* feat(auth): move authStore into Auth feature module\n\n* refactor(auth): update consumers to use co-located authStore\n\n* feat(auth): restore registerUser for e2e compatibility until GraphQL migration lands\n\n* refactor(auth): split login/register state, add stateSanitizer, reset loginError on unmount\n\n- Split shared loading/error into loginLoading/loginError/registerLoading/registerError\n- Export sanitizeAuthState and wire as stateSanitizer in devtools to redact token\n- Clear loginError on LoginForm unmount to prevent stale error across mode switches\n- Fix import/order ESLint errors in LoginForm, RegistrationForm, login.test, register.test\n\n* test(auth): cover sanitizeAuthState and register selectors in integration tests\n\n* fix(auth): resolve auth lint import ordering\n\n* refactor(auth): update auth forms, store, and test coverage\n\n* test(auth): cover register fallback in integration\n\n* fix(auth): reject failed registration submit and harden tests\n\n* fix(auth): address review feedback for login error handling and tests\n\n* test(auth): strengthen BaseAPI edge fixtures and simplify login error flow\n\n* refactor(#45): complete Zustand migration and normalize module naming\n\nRestore and finalize the Redux to Zustand auth-state migration for PR #46.\n\n- Replace Redux Toolkit auth slices with a Zustand store\n  (auth-store, auth-store-actions, auth-selectors)\n- Centralize DI resolution in resolveDeps() and thread dependencies\n  explicitly through typed action contexts instead of per-call container\n  lookups in the feature layer\n- Rename modules, components, and files to kebab-case\n  (User to user, Auth to auth, PascalCase to kebab-case) and adopt aliases\n- Restructure auth API into repositories (login-api, registration-api, base-api)\n- Restructure apollo-server lib into kebab-case modules\n- Add dependency-cruiser config and CI workflow\n- Localize the login error prefix via i18n (sign_in.error_prefix)\n\n* feat(#45): add structured AuthError and AuthResult types\n\n* feat(#45): add UiError/Zod-issue to AuthError mappers\n\n* feat(#45): add AuthRepository interface and result types\n\n* refactor(#45): use class-based AuthErrorFactory and types-only files\n\n* feat(#45): implement class-based AuthRepository folding API, parsing, and errors\n\n* feat(#45): add auth store types and class-based store actions\n\n* feat(#45): register AuthRepository in DI and allow feature stores folder\n\n* feat(#45): add class-based preloaded-token and auth store selectors\n\n* feat(#45): add feature-local auth store factory and composition root\n\n* refactor(#45): move ProtectedRoute into auth feature and use structured store errors\n\n* refactor(#45): remove legacy src/stores auth store and migrate integration coverage\n\n* docs(#45): document feature-local auth store and container-free DI pattern\n\n* test(#45): fix auth store integration tests and restore 100% coverage\n\n* fix(#45): harden auth store flows\n\n* test(#45): fix auth migration CI coverage\n\n* docs(#45): update agents auth guidance\n\n* docs(#45): warn preloaded auth token is test/LHCI only\n\n* docs(#45): correct preloaded auth token safeguard description\n\n* docs(#45): clarify Make injects default preloaded auth token","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJWNoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJlUQAGGH/9O3PI33gBqpfqCD0k2v\nbpgJ+nDqygLcKcVhohf4EtrWygYIlv4aAM4MlB/sRdkuNSJ4h1VcnWBu8HzO3502\ndBN26Q5dDSW6UGYQBM9Jd4tmODSkcqmfNBAIYAf11CQUKR67eYnTAkBLQbQJuIa2\nOMcNqnhZZMhnq1BxSToAEOgzAKycgoPiB0YYgiyYSFKRAlJD0xyGedRswpFPBLO3\nFwHDJ1NZ625cimSWYeAmO+T7BmHqU5ZUhOebU7y7m1Wo2zR53N8Wj4F9F7F2WeV0\nBb8R73kO/2dfxqFSTFbuCorJHjFg5DCvrLP9Kxda5rh1JQfBeCCH+VKYR8KzEfCy\nD8Nz26iSsr2BKR0/WgNhcdm9jvg7QRWIVfc264OTs2ErR7HV6srIKVustfccolna\nyuzpfYi2i4DL4cADlIl51pmTtq2yWUYqNE6ruJdjBNhA7uxuvyTTJWGUPRp/9+dH\n759JqufvaRDIAfvD4U4ozoCAEXLu9fsD5pKPCrZmZaUqmXJribF5SJ/MvJ7c71Ib\nZe1t5WH7t4UKYisaBzrJLb+Rv97XHXgspinEw1wH0iQ8eDH3Akhr1DEoDp8WveW2\nppRq2X3cmA4dr5HMHSuqRm4I00FcenUerbwZeO+yQyKhOJ9E9oyQHUYzda5z6v9y\nONCmUmflyOAfldSh1f0j\n=7KgW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","ver