p>](https://redirect.github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/commit/92ba7fc1d)\n- **browser**:\n- Delay server `listen` until tests start running  -  by\n[@&#8203;sheremet-va](https://redirect.github.com/sheremet-va) in\n[#&#8203;11366](https://redirect.github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/issues/11366)\n[<samp>(7d8ed)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/commit/7d8ed3e9b)\n- Check mock path boundaries  -  by\n[@&#8203;saryn17](https://redirect.github.com/saryn17), **Ryosei Sato**\nand [@&#8203;sheremet-va](https://redirect.github.com/sheremet-va) in\n[#&#8203;11361](https://redirect.github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/issues/11361)\nand\n[#&#8203;11362](https://redirect.github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/issues/11362)\n[<samp>(1c388)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/commit/1c3888bce)\n- Keep config of browser-consumed environments  -  by\n[@&#8203;kasperpeulen](https://redirect.github.com/kasperpeulen) and\n**Claude** in\n[#&#8203;11378](https://redirect.github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/issues/11378)\n[<samp>(aafc0)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/commit/aafc0996f)\n- Ignore page crash while cancelling  -  by\n[@&#8203;sheremet-va](https://redirect.github.com/sheremet-va) in\n[#&#8203;11386](https://redirect.github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/issues/11386)\n[<samp>(7c367)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/commit/7c36748fa)\n- `toMatchScreenshot` uses wrong reference on retried tests  -  by\n[@&#8203;macarie](https://redirect.github.com/macarie) in\n[#&#8203;11393](https://redirect.github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/issues/11393)\n[<samp>(c22ab)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/commit/c22aba992)\n- **cache**:\n- Revalidate imports of cached modules  -  by\n[@&#8203;sheremet-va](https://redirect.github.com/sheremet-va) in\n[#&#8203;11381](https://redirect.github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/issues/11381)\n[<samp>(38f98)</samp>](https://redirect.github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/commit/38f98855f)\n- **deps**:\n- Pin `why-is-nod