-language bundles take up less space on disk and are faster\nto download. We expect to roll this change out to everyone in the coming\nweeks.\n[#&#8203;4146](https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/pull/4146)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won''t be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/runtime-env/runtime-env).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC4xMDMuMCIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQ0LjEwMy4wIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6W119-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"643b47c17f283e262bd217eef306ba8427e1adff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-env/runtime-env/git/trees/643b47c17f283e262bd217eef306ba8427e1adff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-env/runtime-env/git/commits/ea57b0df0c821e86ae8c66a853e498d2cd3f6a8d","verification":{"payload":"tree 643b47c17f283e262bd217eef306ba8427e1adff\nparent 202ff9007c0a826830e435b32c6a83bf001ea93f\nauthor renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1789786138 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789786138 +0000\n\nchore(deps): update github/codeql-action action to v4.38.1 (#985)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n|\n[github/codeql-action](https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action)\n| action | patch | `v4.38.0` → `v4.38.1` |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>github/codeql-action (github/codeql-action)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v4.38.1`](https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/releases/tag/v4.38.1)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/compare/v4.38.0...v4.38.1)\n\n- The CodeQL Action now has experimental support for CodeQL releases for\nwhich per-language bundles are available. Per-language bundles support\nanalysis for a single language and are therefore smaller than the\ncombined bundles that allow analysis for all supported languages. As a\nresult, per-language bundles take up less space on disk and are faster\nto download. We expect to roll this change out to everyone in the coming\nweeks.\n[#&#8203;4146](https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/pull/4146)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won''t be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/runtime-env/runtime-env).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC4xMDMuMCIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQ0LjEwMy4wIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6W119-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrfgaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAI30QAHThMxE7vO+Dc12Fg5KKPKIr\n02fRPnasMRlDyxKP0eemW7oagCbikp/h+UvTsiZI+0b5KgOqHsQw/oDBZKmfZcGw\nYYzmTH109D9treNRjlvTTTGy2PcYVrWBruf44ws9xNhIq472lSVsE/kXoDxjC8Zu\nDt2+p5IlQp9mzqu1qJJ7INQfiLCpB8xAcqu3/HGaTBae4w9kXNXzmtWegFXaO41J\nkt9IVZz3eOWUsdZ3EHz9ZLGPdD6zGSqumwWcIyCgy4+x5hgQ8MOJVbYSy1