github.com/dmchoi77) in\n[#&#8203;1240](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1240)\n- fix: keep lazy shared providers deferred by\n[@&#8203;gioboa](https://redirect.github.com/gioboa) in\n[#&#8203;1243](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1243)\n- fix: serialize concurrent SSR VM linking by\n[@&#8203;gioboa](https://redirect.github.com/gioboa) in\n[#&#8203;1244](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1244)\n- fix: debounce DTS development worker updates by\n[@&#8203;gioboa](https://redirect.github.com/gioboa) in\n[#&#8203;1248](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1248)\n- fix: re-negotiate version-first singletons before host preload skip by\n[@&#8203;arshabh-agarwal](https://redirect.github.com/arshabh-agarwal)\nin\n[#&#8203;1249](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1249)\n- fix: derive SSR entry filenames like the browser ones by\n[@&#8203;Gmendesfonseca](https://redirect.github.com/Gmendesfonseca) in\n[#&#8203;1246](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1246)\n- fix: manage cross-scope shared dependency materialization by\n[@&#8203;gioboa](https://redirect.github.com/gioboa) in\n[#&#8203;1254](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1254)\n- fix: preserve equal-version singleton identity by\n[@&#8203;gioboa](https://redirect.github.com/gioboa) in\n[#&#8203;1256](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1256)\n- fix: do not preload bare remote aliases as root exposes by\n[@&#8203;tonoizer](https://redirect.github.com/tonoizer) in\n[#&#8203;1257](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1257)\n- fix: preserve nested multi-scope initialization by\n[@&#8203;gioboa](https://redirect.github.com/gioboa) in\n[#&#8203;1259](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1259)\n- fix: report current plugin version by\n[@&#8203;gioboa](https://redirect.github.com/gioboa) in\n[#&#8203;1262](https://redirect.g