renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/webpack/5.110.2/5.110.3) |\n![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/npm/webpack/5.110.3?slim=true)\n|\n![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/npm/webpack/5.110.2/5.110.3?slim=true)\n|\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>webpack/webpack (webpack)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v5.110.3`](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#51103)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/compare/v5.110.2...v5.110.3)\n\n##### Patch Changes\n\n- Fix `import()` options, circular reexport severity and namespace\nwrites. (by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21867](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21867))\n\n- Skip ESM interop when require() targets a module outside the\nconcatenation. (by [@&#8203;hai-x](https://redirect.github.com/hai-x) in\n[#&#8203;21884](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21884))\n\n- Fix concatenated `require()` in a `require.ensure` callback or a\ncomputed request. (by [@&#8203;hai-x](https://redirect.github.com/hai-x)\nin\n[#&#8203;21907](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21907))\n\n- Keep `optimization.minimize` a boolean; its options move to\n`minimizeOptions`. (by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21886](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21886))\n\n- Fix mangled exports read through require() and a leaked internal\nreference. (by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21905](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21905))\n\n- Fix `new` on a default import of a wrapped CommonJS module. (by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21876](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21876))\n\n- Throw when a deferred namespace of an async module is forced while it\nevaluates. (by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21871](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21871))\n\n- Do not report a missing export for a name a side-effect-free barrel\ndefers. (by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21874](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21874))\n\n- Fix queue, URL scheme, dotenv, HTTP module and persistent cache edge\ncases. (by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21901](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21901))\n\n- Evaluate a deferred import''s async dependencies where the import sits.\n(by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21902](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21902))\n\n- Omit ambiguous `export *` names from the module namespace. (by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21878](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21878))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won''t be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/runtime-env/runtime-env).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC40OS4wIiwidXBkYXRlZEluVmVyIjoiNDQuNDkuMCIsInRhcmdldEJyYW5jaCI6Im1haW4iLCJsYWJlbHMiOltdfQ==-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d6d41a414a04314833cc0a441151c769b36d45e9"