om/webpack/webpack) | [`5.110.1` →\n`5.110.2`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/webpack/5.110.1/5.110.2) |\n![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/npm/webpack/5.110.2?slim=true)\n|\n![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/npm/webpack/5.110.1/5.110.2?slim=true)\n|\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>webpack/webpack (webpack)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v5.110.2`](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#51102)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/compare/v5.110.1...v5.110.2)\n\n##### Patch Changes\n\n- Fix analyzable ESM baking around cycles, mixed-served wasm and style\nurl maps. (by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21851](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21851))\n\n- Minify more HTML and CSS shorthands, and cut two costs off printing.\n(by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21842](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21842))\n\n- Report a named import that is never read when it names a missing\nexport. (by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21856](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21856))\n\n- Fix ESM circular reexports, cyclic const TDZ, and defer evaluation\norder. (by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21852](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21852))\n\n- Stop `output.html` emitting an unused JS chunk for each generated\npage. (by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21859](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21859))\n\n- Stop emitting the CSS chunk loading runtime when every CSS chunk is\ninitial. (by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21862](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21862))\n\n- Strip a BOM a loader put on a string, and shift a source map that\ncounted it. (by\n[@&#8203;alexander-akait](https://redirect.github.com/alexander-akait)\nin\n[#&#8203;21857](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack/pull/21857))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won''t be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/runtime-env/runtime-env).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC40OS4wIiwidXBkYXRlZEluVmVyIjoiNDQuNDkuMCIsInRhcmdldEJyYW5jaCI6Im1haW4iLCJsYWJlbHMiOltdfQ==-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"dec81a79063c23843dbc6a262ff3341f0cfe9ffd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-env/runtime-env/git/trees/dec81a79063c23843dbc6a262ff3341f0cfe9ffd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-env/runtime-env/git/commits/153d87be0fbb7c25539602f0b04af51ad6fcca16","verification":{"payload":"tree dec81a79063c23843dbc6a262ff3341f0cfe9ffd\nparent 6abf819cd8324845643a786b1a321039a0415b3e\nauthor renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1788111251 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788111251 +0000\n\nchore(deps): update dependency webpack to v5.110.2 (#962)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change |\n[Age](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n[Confidence](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [webpack](https://redirect.github.com/webpack/webpack) | [`5.11