ration/vite/pull/1115)\n- fix: heal stale loadShare IDs directly by\n[@&#8203;gioboa](https://redirect.github.com/gioboa) in\n[#&#8203;1116](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1116)\n- fix: preserve host-owned singleton cache by\n[@&#8203;gioboa](https://redirect.github.com/gioboa) in\n[#&#8203;1117](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1117)\n- fix: control missing import false warnings by\n[@&#8203;gioboa](https://redirect.github.com/gioboa) in\n[#&#8203;1120](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1120)\n- chore: follow-up hardening for recent fixes by\n[@&#8203;gioboa](https://redirect.github.com/gioboa) in\n[#&#8203;1108](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1108)\n\n#### New Contributors\n\n- [@&#8203;Ryan-Haines](https://redirect.github.com/Ryan-Haines) made\ntheir first contribution in\n[#&#8203;1091](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1091)\n- [@&#8203;romain-trotard](https://redirect.github.com/romain-trotard)\nmade their first contribution in\n[#&#8203;1094](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1094)\n- [@&#8203;h11g](https://redirect.github.com/h11g) made their first\ncontribution in\n[#&#8203;1106](https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/vite/pull/1106)\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/module-federation/vite/compare/1.20.7...1.20.8>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won''t be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://develo